{source, model_trial}.
{model, "claude-sonnet-5-5"}.
{interface, "Claude Code 2.1.331 headless (claude -p --model claude-sonnet-5-5), built-in tools and MCP servers off, no settings loaded, system prompt replaced with \"You are a helpful assistant.\", run from an empty directory; Claude Code still adds context of its own (environment and account details). Default sampling, one sample."}.
{recorded_on, "2026-11-24"}.
{expect, pass}.          % the verdict the runner gives since its pause check was fixed
{recheck, "When this was recorded, the runner gave ui_failed: its pause check saw 3 positions while paused. The check timed its window from before the click, so on a busy machine it counted the last frames before the pause. With the window timed from the click, the unchanged reply passes all 13 checks."}.
